 ## Voyage: empty-edit removal crashes a real browser (browser-only defect)
 
 - Acceptance (Cypress, real browser) fails: "should remove the item if an empty text string was
   entered" throws `NotFoundError: removeChild ... node no longer a child` from `render`'s
